# The API's own address. Absolute, because the portal has no proxy in front of
# it — and needs none: it sends no cookie and carries its token in a header, so
# nothing about it depends on sharing an origin with the API.
#
# The build FAILS if this is unset, rather than producing an application that
# requests paths on itself and 404s against its own static host.
VITE_PORTAL_API_URL=https://apartment-management-api.onrender.com
